flowchart TD
    UI[Angular non-standalone frontend] --> API[Market.API controllers]
    API --> AUTH[JWT auth and AdminOnly policies]
    API --> CQRS[Application commands and queries]
    CQRS --> VALIDATION[FluentValidation behavior]
    VALIDATION --> HANDLERS[Command/query handlers]
    HANDLERS --> ABSTRACTIONS[Application abstractions]
    ABSTRACTIONS --> INFRA[Market.Infrastructure services]
    INFRA --> DB[(MovieShopDb SQL Server)]
    INFRA --> PAYPAL[PayPal sandbox]
    INFRA --> EMAIL[Email provider or development logs]
    HANDLERS --> DOMAIN[Market.Domain entities]
